     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the product rule: <span data-math=\"{a^m} \\times {a^n} = {a^{m + n}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{12^{13}} \\times {12^8} = {12^{13 + 8}} = {12^{21}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{12^{21}}\">{12^{21}}</span>"
    }
   ],
